### IPP-1501 Free limit (only free questions without full access) + IPP-1502 delete quiz history
### Use a NORMAL unpaid user. Put passwords while testing, then put CHANGE_ME back.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@userEmail = arsalmustafa62+ipp2@gmail.com
@userPassword = CHANGE_ME
@userToken = {{userLogin.response.body.data.token}}


### ---- IPP-1501: guest ----

### 1. PHP as guest -> 200, ONLY the first topic (PHP: Basics & Syntax, 4 questions, with answers), total 4, "hiddenCount": 16 (IPP-1607)
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions?language=php&limit=50


### 2. Tags as guest -> only tags used by the free questions
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions/tags?language=php


### 3. A paid question by id as guest -> 403, code NEEDS_FULL_ACCESS
###    (put the _id of a NOT free question from Admin -> Questions)
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions/PUT_PAID_QUESTION_ID


### 4. Language -> every topic has qaCount AND freeQaCount (topic tabs show freeQaCount without full access)
GET {{baseUrl}}/languages/php


### ---- unpaid user ----

### 5. Login -> 200
# @name userLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{userEmail}}", "password": "{{userPassword}}" }


### 6. PHP as unpaid user -> same as guest: first topic only, "hiddenCount": 16, "hasFullAccess": false
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions?language=php&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### ---- IPP-1502: delete quiz history (any logged-in user) ----

### 7. History -> note one attempts[]._id (take a sample quiz first if empty)
GET {{baseUrl}}/quiz/history
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### 8. Delete one quiz -> 200 "Quiz deleted from your history" (put the _id from 7)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/quiz/PUT_ATTEMPT_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### 9. Same again -> 404 "Quiz not found" (also 404 for another user's quiz)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/quiz/PUT_ATTEMPT_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### 10. Clear all -> 200 "Quiz history cleared (N quizzes)" or "Your quiz history is already empty", data.deleted
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/quiz/history
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### 11. History after clearing -> stats.totalAttempts 0, attempts []
GET {{baseUrl}}/quiz/history
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### 12. Not logged in -> 401
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/quiz/history


### ---- In the browser (by hand) ----
### Guest or unpaid: /languages/php opens only the first topic (others show "Full access"); scroll to the end -> popup
###   "That's all the free PHP questions" (guest: Create free account / See pricing; user: Get full access / Not now)
###   + a dashed card at the end. Paid user: all 20, no popup.
### Unpaid: finish the sample quiz -> popup "That was the free sample quiz" (once; not again after reload).
### Dashboard -> trash icon on a quiz -> confirm -> gone. "Clear history" -> confirm -> "No quizzes yet".
